# Weakens B's BulkHintBound in this module's environment: the bulk-born leaf's
# birth position is the WAL head at its creation, not the hint the switch took when
# it began, so it lies above a record written during the switch that the leaf does
# not hold at birth. Shows the assumption is load-bearing.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeBulkHintAboveUnheld
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the bulk-born leaf is born at the head at its creation, above an unheld record
PERTURBS: Create
BOUNDS: WithBulk = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a1"] = hint - 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the birth position is the head now, not the hint.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a1"] = next - 1]
--- END
